            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A heat dissipation device (10) is configured for a working fluid to flow therethrough. The heat dissipation device includes a base (100), at least one heat dissipation fin (200), and at least one fluid replenisher (300). The base has at least one internal channel (S) configured for the working fluid to flow therethrough. The at least one heat dissipation fin having an extension channel (201) and an inlet (203) and an outlet (202) is in fluid communication with the extension channel. The at least one heat dissipation fin is inserted into one side of the base, and the extension channel is communicated with the at least one internal channel through the inlet and the outlet. The at least one fluid replenisher is connected to at least one internal channel.</p>
            </abstract>
